[center][size=4][b]The physics engine behind [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109435]Anatomy[/url], as a drop-in replacement for OCBPC's cbp.dll. With Anatomy it gives her body bones added at run time, openings that respond to contact, lips that fit what is at them and, with Rapport, her faces and glances; her partner's side is the aim, the shape and one-tube collision. On its own, every OCBPC config collides better with it.[/b][/size][/center]

